{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":51.40999984741211,"text":"If Knossos is the empty building, this museum is what was inside it. Almost everything important that came out of the Minoan palaces of Crete is here, and it is the largest collection of Minoan finds anywhere. The frescoes of Knossos are here, not at Knossos. Up there you see copies, so the originals do not bleach in the sun. The museum shows something surprising. The Minoans painted almost no wars. They painted dolphins, lilies, monkeys, people vaulting over bowls, women in elaborate dresses. They painted life rather than victories. And there is one object here that nobody has managed to read, although specialists have been staring at it for more than a hundred years. If you only have time for one museum on the whole island, archaeologists will tell you to pick this one, and then go up to Knossos to see where all of it once stood.","words":[{"word":"If","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"Knossos","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"is","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"the","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.5800000429153442},{"word":"empty","start":1.5800000429153442,"end":1.8799999952316284},{"word":"building","start":1.8799999952316284,"end":2.1600000858306885},{"word":"this","start":2.740000009536743,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"museum","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.2799999713897705},{"word":"is","start":3.2799999713897705,"end":3.6600000858306885},{"word":"what","start":3.6600000858306885,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"was","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"inside","start":4.059999942779541,"end":4.300000190734863},{"word":"it","start":4.300000190734863,"end":4.679999828338623},{"word":"Almost","start":5.21999979019165,"end":5.440000057220459},{"word":"everything","start":5.440000057220459,"end":6.059999942779541},{"word":"important","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.519999980926514